    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The equation <math alttext=\"46 equals 2 a plus 2 b\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>46</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>a</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>b</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow></math> gives the relationship between the side lengths <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math> of a certain parallelogram. If <math alttext=\"a equals 9\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>a</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>9</mn>\n</mrow></math>, what is the value of <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math>?</p>",
