    "difficulty": "easy",
    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A line in the <em>xy</em>-plane has a slope of <math alttext=\"negative one half\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> and passes through the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Which equation represents this line?</p>",
    "type": "mcq",
    "correctAnswer": "B",
    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. A line in the <em>xy</em>-plane with a slope of <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi></math> and a <em>y</em>-intercept of <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma b right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> can be represented by the equation <math alttext=\"y equals m x plus b\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>. It's given that the line has a slope of <math alttext=\"negative one half\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. Therefore, <math alttext=\"m equals negative one half\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. It's also given that the line passes through the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore, <math alttext=\"b equals 3\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"negative one half\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> for <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi></math> and <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn></math> for <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math> in the equation <math alttext=\"y equals m x plus b\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math> yields <math alttext=\"y equals minus one half x plus 3\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Therefore, the equation <math alttext=\"y equals minus one half x plus 3\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math> represents this line.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This equation represents a line in the <em>xy</em>-plane that passes through the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This equation represents a line in the <em>xy</em>-plane that has a slope of <math alttext=\"one half\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, not <math alttext=\"negative one half\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, and passes through the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This equation represents a line in the <em>xy</em>-plane that has a slope of <math alttext=\"one half\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, not <math alttext=\"negative one half\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>",
