    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. The <em>y</em>-intercept of a line graphed in the <em>xy</em>-plane is the point where the line intersects the <em>y</em>-axis. The line graphed intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 8 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore, the <em>y</em>-intercept of the line graphed is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 8 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>",
