    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi></math> is defined by <math alttext=\"y equals 7 x plus one eighth\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mn>1</mn>\n\t\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow></math>. Line <math alttext=\"j\"><mi>j</mi></math> is perpendicular to line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane. What is the slope of line <math alttext=\"j\"><mi>j</mi></math>?</p>",
