        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals negative one fourth x plus 2\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>1</mn>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n</mrow></math></p>"
